:30,"source_sha256":"fa50bb34a5ea3562c2f54a7c6cc16a96dbcd103be0a57670d26acae912da5970","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":21},{"dia_id":"D30:22","global_turn_index":566,"locator":"[S30T22]","raw_turn_sha256":"5c826987cf890e773fcbc7cc96116f4da7b1ec8d9d5fabbd77949718bb579164","rendered_turn_sha256":"170ea461d92ea5f35569f0603e2d700c99ad488a6803928d79010593da6f74d2","session_date":"2023-11-17","session_datetime":"2023-11-17T10:54:00","session_id":"session_30","session_index":30,"source_sha256":"1ebd2ab1394acaebf5528c4e1e1b05b07b5595540a59cecc26fe1d2b416e86bb","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":22},{"dia_id":"D30:23","global_turn_index":567,"locator":"[S30T23]","raw_turn_sha256":"0f17909f7891ef203e064ef591f394e3e5b96d70aeadb8f7d55c628c6df07102","rendered_turn_sha256":"bf28ba0e7922ec9a4d4b50fa25d4d6e38c934ecbb7da8c2635c73bc4e0aae415","session_date":"2023-11-17","session_datetime":"2023-11-17T10:54:00","session_id":"session_30","session_index":30,"source_sha256":"a7049ac013bc5da25c55f6a2fbbd8d1b565ea00110f0d78775080fd6e87daf57","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":23},{"dia_id":"D30:24","global_turn_index":568,"locator":"[S30T24]","raw_turn_sha256":"aabba3ecc9ff029935e35534c34ed3b9f0ff69f1fc23d0909f17b30e198c8960","rendered_turn_sha256":"19aae2d71e03f50be2694151f2a92628102b5bc0a3cabd585551052a99b7d2a2","session_date":"2023-11-17","session_datetime":"2023-11-17T10:54:00","session_id":"session_30","session_index":30,"source_sha256":"b1112e12756742bd43795fac70cd818da829d92b77e29af173be10fcdbe7919f","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":24}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- On 2023-11-17, reconnected with Dave (\"Hey Calvin, long time no talk!\" — Calvin: \"Hey Dave, it's great to hear from you! Can't wait to see your pics.\"): Calvin told Dave he went to a \"fancy gala\" in Boston the day before (2023-11-16) and met some interesting people — \"Check out this pic of me and the crew!\" — sharing a photo of a group of men sitting on a rock next to a river (details in ## Boston trip); Dave (whose message also carried a photo of a boat floating in the water at sunset): \"Calvin, that event looks amazing! You all look awesome. Who did you have the most interesting chat with?\" [S30T1][S30T2][S30T3]. Calvin: he had a really interesting chat with \"this cool artist\" — \"we clicked over music and art. We talked about our favorite artists, art, and how the power of music connects us all.\" — \"It was such an inspiring conversation - I feel like I'm on a creative high.\" — and shared a photo of the two of them sitting on a bench in the snow (details in ## Music); Dave: \"That's amazing, Calvin! Music really does bring people together and foster creativity. Glad to hear you had such an inspiring conversation!\" — and, in the same message, shared a photo of his new vintage camera that he bought this month (November 2023) (a photo of a camera sitting on a table next to a plant) — \"which takes awesome photos!\" (Dave's details in the Photography section of /memories/dave.md) [S30T4][S30T5]. Calvin: \"Hey Dave, music really brings people together, huh? Do you use this camera for photos? They always turn out so good!\"; Dave: yes — \"this camera is very good, it helps me capture those special moments really clearly.\" [S30T6][S30T7]. Calvin: \"Having a good camera is key for capturing those special moments. What do you like to take photos of?\" (Calvin's message closed with a photo of a sunset with a wave crashing on rocks) [S30T8]. The chat then continued: Dave — being able to take good pics is key and he loves capturing the beauty of nature (sunsets, beaches, waves), sharing a sunset/wave pic he got recently (Calvin: \"Nice job, Dave! That shot looks great! Nature's so amazing!\") — then a pic he snapped the previous week (~2023-11-10/16): a peaceful waterfall flowing over rocks and boulders, taken at a serene spot in a nearby park (Calvin: \"Wow Dave, that picture is stunning! Where was that taken? It looks so serene!\"; Dave: a nearby park; Calvin: \"Wow, that sounds like such a peaceful and serene spot. Can't wait to check it out myself sometime.\"); the two agreed nature's beauty conveys emotion and can boost the spirits in tough times (\"Like a breath of fresh air!\"); Calvin closed that part of the exchange with a photo he shot in a Japanese garden (a bench under a tree with pink flowers) — \"Check out this beautiful picture that I shot in a Japanese garden, that's wild!\" (Dave's side in the Photography and Parks sections of /memories/dave.md; Calvin's own nature photos in the Photography section of this file) [S30T9][S30T10][S30T11][S30T12][S30T13][S30T14][S30T15][S30T16]. The chat then continued: Dave: \"Cool, Calvin! Found an even better spot, with a bench under a tree with pink flowers - so peaceful. A perfect spot to relax and take in the beauty.\" (Dave's remark — he describes it as \"a spot,\" while Calvin had just shared a photo of a Japanese garden matching that description); Calvin: \"That sounds great, Dave! Can't wait to see it.\" [S30T17][S30T18]. Dave: \"Check it out, Calvin. It's really calming, I think you'll like it. We will definitely go there!\" — and asked whether there was anything else Calvin would like to share [S30T19]. Calvin: yes — he has a few more great news: he's accepted an invitation to perform at an upcoming show in Boston — \"It's going to be an unforgettable musical experience!\" — and he'll fill Dave in on all the details later (details in ## Music); Dave: \"Wow, Calvin! That's amazing news! Congratulations on both the gala attendance and the upcoming performance. I can't wait to hear all about it and maybe even catch one of your shows in Boston. Let me know when you're free to catch up. Cheers to your musical journey!\" [S30T20][S30T21]. Calvin: \"Thanks, Dave! I'll catch you when I'm in Boston. Cheers!\" — and the chat closed with goodbyes — Dave: \"Looking forward to seeing you. Stay safe, talk to you soon!\" and Calvin: \"Thanks! You too. Talk to you later!\" [S30T22][S30T23][S30T24].","text_sha256":"c2977cd6df78501a7c980e4c7fbc3d9fae147978d6b46560b2925866e0e54d10","timestamp":"2023-11-17T10:54:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","pre_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":1540,"filesystem_tool_calls":4,"model_calls":6,"orchestration_calls":3,"prompt_tokens":155775,"provider_request_attempts":6,"provider_rounds":5,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":157315},"model":{"requested_model":"coding","served_models":["qwen3.8:27b"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"56a7ee328b702acf677218605c2d649afe0089eda09165e5aadb286969116965","filesystem_tools_sha256":"6d9d68f047917d20adb9133168d5726233c9719dbefd54627e08827832d963c6","orchestration_actions_sha256":"3506af86ae75acd7ce07f88bae7a25e1bfec56a5b1c9f44abd3d71a2e6f4eb2d","paper_prompt_id":"filesystem-appendix-a3-prompt-5-normalized-v1","paper_prompt_sha256":"de03315ff999a8bcea7e08a10866f3a6dc74badf690d23a036e35c74ff81335c"},"protocol_version":"shared-evidence-bundle-v1","question":{"conversation_id":"conv-50","question":"When did Dave buy a vintage camera?","question_id":"conv-50-q070","question_set_id":"locomo-conv50-main40-v1","run_position":31,"schema_version":1},"question_sha256":"ee62b943961280007018747a63206d74fe7f26e8479f09fc8fc41a71b58e5ed1","runtime_contract":{"evidence_budget_limit":16000,"evidence_budget_unit":"characters","round_limit":40,"runtime_sha256":"a217e40af4a88841d2e56d9a339e30900833cd0e857ee6412d2b1b7afeb00f56"},"schema_version":1,"search_actions":[{"action_ordinal":1,"canonical_args":{"end_line":-1,"path":"/memories","start_line":1},"content_sha256":"b42aa915e87aafc08d47ccfccee1143d0c46c73f1e55475b7219347ed638e969","coverage":[],"kind":"filesystem_observation","observation_id":"obs-0001","obs